They were doing that in twenty eighteen income's
Donald Trump.

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:20.030
We have the pandemic and it really starts
to seem that more vote by mail is going to

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.170
be bad for Donald Trump.

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:26.810
So in 2020, the Republican Party does a 180
that a lot of people don't even know is a

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:28.870
180 and starts opposing vote by mail.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:30.440
It'll lead to fraud.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:34.280
It'll lead to, you know, all these different
things that didn't happen.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:38.920
And it turned out that if it helped in twenty
twenty, it didn't help enough in the sense

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:43.590
